WEBVTT

00:14:29.295 --> 00:14:32.293
And I thought, "OK,
so I'm just doing this hobby."

00:14:32.317 --> 00:14:36.059
And it's funny, because
now that I'm a professional writer,

00:14:36.083 --> 00:14:38.675
I mean, I still have the sense of, like,

00:14:38.699 --> 00:14:42.582
it's some of my happiest moments
when I have my daily writing sessions,

00:14:42.606 --> 00:14:45.863
but every so often,
the stresses of it do creep in.

00:14:45.887 --> 00:14:49.143
And when that happens,
I always try to bring myself back

00:14:49.167 --> 00:14:52.637
to the way writing was for me
at the very beginning,

00:14:52.661 --> 00:14:56.803
when I had zero expectations
and it was just a matter of, like,

00:14:56.827 --> 00:14:59.586
"I'm going to sit in
the sunny café window and type."